Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\blur3}[拉丁文]在父亲 孩子 还有圣明之下 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pater filius et Spiritus Sanctus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.87,0:31:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\blur3}[法语]事情会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ainsi sera…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\blur3}[法语]朝着有利的方向发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}grogne qui grogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.30,0:45:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\blur3}[拉丁文]以圣父 圣子和圣灵的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}In nomine patris filius et Spiritus Sancto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为你了解历史 其实你了解的只是历史的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you know a story but you only know how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要了解历史的真谛 就必须回到历史的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to the heart of the story you have to go back to the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坎贝吉奥主教大人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Eminence, Cardinal Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}劳伦佐 我的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorenzo, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得原谅我行动不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace must forgive my incapacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝让我患上痛风 这是对我的一个考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has given me gout as a great trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在… 王国陛下非常希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, His Majesty is very keen…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:03:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特使会议能立即召开\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the legatine court be set up straight away…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽早裁定他离婚一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to determine the case for his annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这里有教皇大人关于此事的手谕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the pope's written commission to decide upon this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且据我所知 这是不可更改的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from my decision, there can be no appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人能不能让我喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Your Grace has some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以的话 掺点酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mixed perhaps with a little wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我交情不浅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我都是过来人了 沃尔西主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are both men of the world, Cardinal Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有个儿子和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even have a son who travels with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇想要满足国王的请求 尽管有些困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Holiness wishes to satisfy the king, however difficult that might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撇开这些不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for all our sakes, would it not be better…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能劝国王放弃离婚 岂不是更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you and I were to try and persuade His Majesty to give up his divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:04:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 他对这个… 姑娘的热情会随着时间退却\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely his passion for this girl will alter and fade with time…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热情终究是会减退的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as all such passions inevitably do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕主教大人你有所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear Your Eminence may have proceeded here in ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那让我直说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make certain things plain to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不批准国王的离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do not grant the king his divorce…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇在英格兰的权威将不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}…papal authority in England will be annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该知道 现在德国的大部分地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should remember, the greater part of Germany…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都已经脱离了罗马教廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has already become estranged from Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里难保不发生同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing could happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这将意味着王国的灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would mean the total ruin of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果宣布你们的婚姻无效 会不会带来不良的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any danger that they could declare your marriage valid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西向我保证教皇会考虑我的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey has assured me that the pope has already decided in my favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会议只是形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trial's just for the sake of appearances…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安抚一下皇帝而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a way of appeasing the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们可以开始策划婚礼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can start planning the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:05:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 吾爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谨慎起见 还需要下点别的工夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also for the sake of appearances, there is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要继续和凯瑟林一起用餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while, I shall have to share Catherine's table.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶尔还得和她共寝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes her bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 共寝？- 这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her bed? - It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的律师建议我这样做 否则会落下把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lawyers have just advised me that to do otherwise might risk countersuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会侵犯了她与丈夫同居的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be seen to be acting against her conjugal rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得回去和你妻子共寝不算什么 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's nothing to go back to bed with your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得会发生什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think is going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像以前发生过的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What usually happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我就这么点信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}How little you trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事不该责怪凯瑟林 也不怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine is not to blame for this. Nor am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实是 大人 我们违背了上帝的法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the fact is, Excellence, we broke God's law…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此罪难赦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for which there can be no dispensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该知道这让我的良知倍受煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand how deeply this touches my conscience…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到底还有多久才能解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and how quickly I need it to be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. I sympathise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇陛下也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does His Holiness, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时教皇陛下也给您提供了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But His Holiness also suggests to Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}…another possible solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经对主教大人说得很清楚了 陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have already made it plain to Your Eminence that His Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 普里哥 这可不一样 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is not the same, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个办法 国王陛下应该会满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a solution which should very much please His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇了解王后陛下是个虔诚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Holiness is aware of the queen's great piety.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她本人也提及过 她对圣母圣徒等的敬爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She herself has spoken of it, her love for the Mother of God, for the saints.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇认为可以规劝王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wonders if Her Majesty might be persuaded…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像路易十二曾经的妻子 珍妮－德－瓦洛瓦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like Jeanne de Valois, the sometime wife of Louis Xll…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宣布放弃婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to abdicate her marriage…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遁入空门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and retreat to a nunnery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得如何 沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这当然能把事情简单化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it would certainly expedite matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}免去了审议的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would save us the pain of a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于是自愿行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since it would be voluntary…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就不会激怒她的侄子 皇帝陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it couldn't offend her nephew, the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此外 这也能让王后体面的退位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And moreover, it would afford Her Majesty an honourable retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你马上去和王后商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will put this to her right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下能不能考虑一下这个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Your Majesty at least consider the proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我和我的丈夫 国王陛下谈话以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you my answer in due course…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会及时给你答复的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after I have spoken with the king, my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 一会能听我忏悔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, will you hear my confession later?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 王后陛下 - 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求您满足国王的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg that you yield to the king's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他的什么要求 - 如主教大人所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what is his will? - As His Eminence proposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}选择加入一个宗教组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you join a religious community of your choosing…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发誓永守贞洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and take a vow of perpetual chastity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还有脸和我提贞洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak to me of chastity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忘记你的情妇和两个孩子了吗 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not a mistress and two children, Your Eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下已是而立之年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is entering the third period of your natural life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您已经为这个世界树立了一个良好的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spent the first two setting a good example.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样一来更能为您的美德锦上添花\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this single act, you could put the seal on all your good actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请起来 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please rise, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是什么理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not seemly for a man of your dignity…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这样尊贵的人都不该在公共场合有失身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be seen to beg in public, whatever the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你和坎贝吉奥谈过了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you talked to Campeggio? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉他 要经过你的允许 我才能做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him I could not give an answer without Your Majesty's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那要怎么答复他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what answer will you give him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我会告诉他事实 - 凯瑟林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will tell him the truth. - Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在全世界都知道 你我的婚姻是不正当的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the world now agrees that your marriage to me was unjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你本人也必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you must acknowledge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么你自愿 要么我逼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you agree to take the veil, I shall have to force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你允许我和坎贝吉奥谈话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have your permission to talk to Campeggio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不允许 我不会对他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not speak to him if you do not want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的夫人 - 安妮夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My lady. - Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你… 你有国王那边的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a message from the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都应该记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们彼此的朋友 费西先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mutual friend, a Mr. Fish, now living in exile in Holland…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在被放逐到荷兰 他有礼物带给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has sent me a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么礼物 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Master Cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「顺从基督」 威廉－廷代尔写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Obedience of the Christian Man by William Tyndale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面指责了教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains many good criticisms of the papacy…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有教士的无知和贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and of the arrogance and abuses of priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会觉得很有启发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find it most illuminating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你千万不能让别人看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}But always and ever be cautious as to whom you show this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要知道拥有这种书就算是异教\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must know it might be accounted heresy even to possess it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而沃尔西对于绞杀异教徒乐此不疲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Wolsey is still keen enough to prosecute heretics…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样称呼我们 我们这些信仰正教的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as we are called, who embrace the true religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God bless you, Master Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:10:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能把这个转交给国王…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, will you give this to the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鸡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鸡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chick…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘… 嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}shh… shh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从来没告诉过我你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never even told me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 简 - 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane. - Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么离开宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you leave the court?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐去世以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your sister died…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐还在这儿 托马斯－塔里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister is still here, Thomas Tallis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她没有离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不会离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也能看见她 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see her too, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从伦敦一路过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came all the way from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的希望你能回到宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I really want you to come back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢我姐姐胜过我 我看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You liked my sister more than me. I could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想娶你 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to marry you, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想忏悔什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you wish to confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 我想告诉你 我和陛下的兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I wish to tell you about my first marriage to Prince Arthur…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚瑟王子第一次的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…His Majesty's older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说过 你继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know of it. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他根本就不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never knew me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以用最神圣的东西起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you, under the sacramental oath…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和亨利结婚之前 我并没有和亚瑟有过婚姻之实\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I was intacta e incorrupta da lui comme venne dal ventre di sua madra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你从出生到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you were untouched and unviolated by Prince Arthur…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就从来没有和亚瑟王子有过任何肉体接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as when you came from the womb of your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和陛下结婚的时候还是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you came to the king's bed a virgin, intacta e incorrupta?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 我并无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I say in all humility…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不能接受你的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I cannot accede to your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是亨利合法的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the true and legitimate wife of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的建议我不能采纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore your proposal is inadmissible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come what may…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我与我的婚姻共存亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will live and die in that vocation to matrimony…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to which God has called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 我允许你违反忏悔的沉默约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furthermore, I give you permission to break the seal of the confessional…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我说的话告诉全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and tell the whole world what I have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利要你回宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry wants you back at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你毕竟是他的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are his sister after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他带着那个荡妇招摇过市 我怎么能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I return while he flaunts himself with his slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就等于我默许了他的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be seen to be approving of his ridiculous liaison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛格丽特 没有国王的照应 我们两人将一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret, you and I must stay in the king's good graces or we are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他爱娶谁就娶谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him marry who he wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你的哲学 不是吗 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was always your philosophy, wasn't it, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}So very cynical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你才和那个罪恶的博林交好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you keep company with that devil Boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他帮我们重回宫廷那阵 你不是也很喜欢他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You liked him enough once when he helped us back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在表现得那么愤世嫉俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or were you just being cynical?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时不知道他的算盘 现在我知道了 我鄙视他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see all of his game. Now I do, I despise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是 但我更恨沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I. But I hate Wolsey more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这样的婚姻只是权宜之计 - 就像我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a marriage of expedience. - Rather like ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你懂爱字的含意吗 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the meaning of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can love…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年 一个月 一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…perhaps for a year or a month, a day…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那一小时里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that hour…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爱得那么深…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I do believe you love as well and deeply…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和任何男人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那一小时过后 你就不爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after that hour, you love not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.70,0:16:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就去爱另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love another…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your love…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很慷慨 也很伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is most generous where it is most hurtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛格丽特 - 别装傻 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Margaret. - Don't play the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't become you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要见坎贝吉奥主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see Cardinal Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 大人不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. My father is indisposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}况且 对于现在的情况他已经无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, there is nothing further he can do for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他送了些报告回罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has sent some reports to Rome…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须等待教皇陛下的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and must await the replies from His Holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the meantime…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的父亲需要休息 恢复体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my poor father needs to rest and restore his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 安妮夫人 - 晚上好 安妮夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Anne. - Good evening, Lady Anne Boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这就是那位叫博林的情妇吗 - 是的 就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is the Mistress Boleyn? - Yes, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王为了这个女人要牺牲他的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl for whom the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牺牲一个仁慈 充满爱心的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would sacrifice his marriage to a most gracious and loving queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽力劝过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tried to argue him out of his course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我打赌 就算是天使下凡也劝不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I swear that an angel descending from heaven would not dissuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得他们是否已经联合在一起了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they have taken things to the ultimate conjunction?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到了萨福克 诺福克公爵 和博林爵爷的联合请愿书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've received a petition from the dukes of Suffolk, Norfolk and Lord Boleyn…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说离婚一事 受到大部分国民的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}…saying the divorce has the support of the people of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要主教大人出去看看民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Your Eminence would quickly discover…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快就能发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you stepped outside these doors and saw the people…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是弥天大谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that is a manifest lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正好相反 人们爱戴他们的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, the people love their queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们这样做有充分的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they have every reason to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:19:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 沃尔西 - 王后陛下拒绝了提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wolsey. - Her Majesty has refused the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很惊奇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且 坎贝吉奥告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, Campeggio tells me…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇愿意承认 您和博林情妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the pope is prepared to consider legitimising any children…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生下的孩子是合法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that you might have with Mistress Boleyn…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论你们是否结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whether you are married or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该取得比这更好的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to do a lot better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰一下 门多萨大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Ambassador Mendoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我初来乍到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am new to this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些和国王交谈的人都是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these men talking with the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理齐福德爵爷 是安妮－博林的父亲 诺福克是她的叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Rochford is the father of Anne Boleyn, Norfolk is her uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和萨福克公爵一样 都是沃尔西的死敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Duke of Suffolk, they are Wolsey's sworn enemies…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宫里的人都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and everyone at court knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了拉他下水 他们会不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would stop at nothing to bring him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王还是信任他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the king still loves him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不如以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much as before, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但绝对不能低估了主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the cardinal should never be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能告诉我你对这事的看法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I know what you think of the king's matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝的态度不是秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is no secret that the emperor is outraged…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很愤怒国王对王后的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at the king's behaviour toward the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 你可千万不能说出去 他写过信给教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can tell you in strict confidence that he has written to His Holiness…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求在罗马 而不是在这里 解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}…demanding that the matter be settled in Rome, not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有没有想过 以别的办法干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not seek to interfere in any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果王后被废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if the queen were to be renounced…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有没有考虑以她的名义武力干预\N{\fnArial\fs30}…might he consider military intervention on her behalf?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没这么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has not said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有人问过他吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has anyone asked him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 玛格丽特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别和她在一起 她不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not her. She's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她只是个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a cheap nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睁开眼睛 好好看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes. Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}管好你自己的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look to your own marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欲火焚身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning with impatience.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 沃翰大主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady, Archbishop Warham…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和唐斯多主教求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Bishop Tunstall are here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你们是特使会议的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that you are among my council for the legatine court.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为正直的人 你们的职责是对得起上帝和良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}As honourable men whose first duty is to God and your conscience…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you are welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是国王派你们来的吗 - 是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has the king sent you? - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们来讨论一下案子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must discuss your brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.10,0:22:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我全心全意爱着国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing against His Majesty, whom I love with all my being…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.50,0:22:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是恨他的顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}…only against his advisers…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有那个有野心毁了这个国家的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a certain woman whose ambition would ruin a kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我们不是来讨论案子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, we are not here to discuss a brief or any such.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但是… - 我们是来汇报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - We came here to report, madam…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:23:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谣传境外有人密谋刺杀国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that rumours of plots against the life of His Majesty are abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有坎贝吉奥大主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}And plots against Cardinal Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果密谋成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any such plots were to be successful…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.20,0:23:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然您和您的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then clearly both you and your daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都脱不了嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would be suspected of involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我简直不敢相信国王会听信这些谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe the king would give credence to such rumours…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该知道 你们也应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…since he knows, as you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我珍惜我丈夫的生命胜过我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I value my husband's life even much more than my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 还有一个情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, there is yet another complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太轻率 在民众面前露面太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you are flippant and show yourself too much to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您喜欢他们的欢呼 并对他点头微笑挥手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you rejoice in their acclaim, smiling, nodding and waving at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有此可见 你恨国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, we suppose that you hate the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凭什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should you suppose that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 因为你不肯承认 和他的婚姻生活是一种罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you don't accept that all this time you've been living in sin with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使现在真相大白 你也拒绝国王的慷慨提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when the truth has been revealed, you refuse to accept the king's offer…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.10,0:23:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去侍奉上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…offer to retire to a religious house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.10,0:24:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经答复过了 上帝并没有招呼我去做修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have answered for that already. God never called me to a nunnery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是国王陛下合法的真正的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am His Majesty's true and legitimate wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 看在上帝的份儿上… - 是的 看在上帝的份儿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Madam, for the love of God… - Yes, for the love of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.40,0:24:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己也公认过 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you yourself once professed, archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉人们我的罪名是莫须有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told people that you knew my case to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在为什么改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为沃尔西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it Wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 你是不是对你在人间的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, do you prefer your place in this earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比对在天堂的地位更看重\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rather than your place in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对这些指责你还没有答复 - 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have not answered the charges. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被自己的律师起诉 这让我无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I consider it hard indeed to be charged and accused by my own lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.33,0:24:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这算什么公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the justice in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.60,0:24:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会再见你们 你们也不再代表我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will speak to you no more, but you will not act for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么否认我的公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you go on denying me justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.60,0:25:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满了恨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So full of hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不要再骗自己说你爱我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't persuade myself any longer that you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.30,0:26:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的确爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未停止过爱你 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never ceased to love you. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你该离我们的女儿远点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should be kept away from our daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.10,0:26:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}免得给她坏的影响 让她恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in case you start poisoning her mind against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.70,0:26:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能对我说这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say these things to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.30,0:26:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一起走过那么久 曾经在彼此心里有过那样的分量\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all this time, after all that we have meant to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你能讲道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only asking you to be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讲道理 不肯讲道理的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am being reasonable. It is you who will not be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.20,0:26:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底想要什么 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you really want, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.60,0:26:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 想要什么 - 对于你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want? - In life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.30,0:26:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.70,0:26:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我想是旅行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Travel, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果可以的话 去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adventure, if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旅行 你想去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel? Where would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没听书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}航海家已经出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea discoverers to new worlds have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡伯特去新的大陆 有的去美洲和印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cabot to Newfoundland, others to America, the Indies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.80,0:27:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有的去中国 丝绸王国 马可－波罗故事中的国度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some speak of China, Cathay, the fabled lands of Marco Polo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.20,0:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会从这里出发…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd set out here…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.30,0:27:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头发是充满伏兵和圈套的丛林\N{\fnArial\fs30}…though the hair is a forest of ambush and snares.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.30,0:27:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是眉毛能让人平静 像安宁的平原\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the brow becalms us when it's smooth and plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼窝对于船队很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the dark pools of the eyes are dangerous to our ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陷进去就会失事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for to be drawn into them would be shipwreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.60,0:27:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鼻子就像子午线 带我们到嘴唇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nose, like the first meridian, directs us down…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.30,0:28:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸运之岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the Islands Fortunate…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the swelling lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.10,0:28:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抛锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would anchor here…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.20,0:28:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听海妖的歌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and hear the siren songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.60,0:28:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后继续航行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then sailing on…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越过下巴这个海角\N{\fnArial\fs30}…past the glorious promontory of chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.60,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也许会遇到一些海岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may encounter survivors…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后航行到你的印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as we travel down towards your India.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在大西洋上停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we pause at the Atlantic navel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.10,0:28:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海浪会带着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the current carries our pilot on…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.30,0:28:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去到另一个丛林\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to another forest…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.60,0:28:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有很多船只遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where many are shipwrecked…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.00,0:28:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旅行到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and no further ever get.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.70,0:29:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有了个新的座右铭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a new motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.40,0:29:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得自己去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一条丝带上 藏在某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a piece of ribbon hidden somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.20,0:29:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是… 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.00,0:29:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.40,0:29:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那这里呢 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down there? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.90,0:30:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能再等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.80,0:30:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不用再等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.68,0:30:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emm…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.00,0:30:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下… 事情又被拖延下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, there are fresh delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都见不到坎贝吉奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can see Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快告诉我 在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.50,0:30:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许有人是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if someone is deliberately stalling?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有意拖延 寻找借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delaying things, making excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坎贝吉奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Campeggio?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是别的人 离你更近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, someone else, someone much closer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.90,0:31:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我摸到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.70,0:31:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情会朝着有利的方向发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们抱怨去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them grumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.20,0:31:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个和你更接近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone much closer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.60,0:31:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于坎贝吉奥 我想问问你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to ask you frankly about Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.10,0:31:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.00,0:31:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得他妥协了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he's compromised?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁知道呢 也许他收了皇帝的贿赂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows, perhaps he's getting a pension from the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知 劳伦佐不是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I know it, Lorenzo is the least prejudicial of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他本人也受够了查尔斯手下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has suffered personally at the hands of Charles's soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.60,0:32:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们到达罗马的时候 洗劫了他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they entered Rome, they ransacked his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.10,0:32:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他对皇帝没什么好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe he has love for the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.30,0:32:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他为什么拖延会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why is he delaying the trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有些技术上的东西需要解决 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are some technical matters that need to be resolved, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.60,0:32:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您根本不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing for Your Majesty to be concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.60,0:32:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的 根本就不是坎贝吉奥 就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it. It's not Campeggio at all, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.50,0:32:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你在拖 你对离婚的事漠不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one delaying things. You've gone cold on this divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一开始就不信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you never believed in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.80,0:32:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我撒谎 假装站在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me, pretending to be on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.60,0:32:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我向您 向上帝 以我的名誉起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I swear before you and before God on my honour…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是您最谦卑的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am your most humble servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个世界上 我最希望的事情就是您能离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is nothing on earth I covet so much as advancing your divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.20,0:32:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它实现是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to bring it to pass is my continual study…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.20,0:32:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是我最虔诚的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and my most ardent desire…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.80,0:32:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意为此献出我的生命 我的肉体 我的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for which I am ready to expend my life and my body and my blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.40,0:32:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 请您帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so help me God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.30,0:33:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 大人 别这么沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, Your Grace. Don't be so dismayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.90,0:33:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该理解我的不耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand my impatience.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.50,0:33:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.40,0:33:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你了解已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.50,0:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 我们谈谈别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let's talk of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.40,0:33:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}By God's body, Master More.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.50,0:33:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王子的愤怒意味着死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anger of the prince means death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:33:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.70,0:34:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 我要你去罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go to Rome, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你去让该死的教皇服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to force His fucking Holiness into submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.60,0:34:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有必要的话 告诉他 如果他不取消我该死的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}If necessary, telling him that if he does not grant me my annulment…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.10,0:34:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰将不再听从教廷差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…England will withdraw its submission to Rome…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.60,0:34:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不再效忠他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I will withdraw my allegiance to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他知道 我可不是说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make sure he knows this is no idle threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.50,0:34:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他不能满足我 我说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it and I will do it if he does not satisfy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.30,0:34:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫萨福克公爵进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.40,0:34:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人 国王召见\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Duke, the king summons you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.20,0:34:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.80,0:34:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有事要你办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a task for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.60,0:34:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你去巴黎见弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go to Paris and seek out King Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}细细问一下坎贝吉奥的底细\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question him closely about Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.60,0:34:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问问他们之间有什么交情 他是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him what kind of dealings he's had with him, what kind of man he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.40,0:34:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否诚实 有没有做教皇的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he honest? Does he have any ambitions to be pope?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.20,0:34:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和皇帝私下有没有什么交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ask him, does he have any secret dealings with the emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.20,0:34:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.80,0:35:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Charles…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟他谈一谈关于沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ask him about Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.50,0:35:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要他直言不讳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know everything he knows about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.23,0:35:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 明白了吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - Emm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.70,0:35:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要知道沃尔西到底站在哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know whose side Wolsey's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.80,0:35:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.60,0:35:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最伟大的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most gracious sovereign lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带了费西主教来见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought Bishop Fisher to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信他能给您最诚挚的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he can offer you true and devoted counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.10,0:35:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.10,0:35:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.60,0:36:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人 你真的想代理我的案件吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Bishop, are you certain that you wish to act for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.00,0:36:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得知道 这很困难 也许会给你带来危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be aware of the dangers and difficulties you may face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.10,0:36:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想置身事外 我也可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would understand if you would prefer peace and tranquillity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.30,0:36:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 没有公正和上帝之爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentle madam, what peace or tranquillity can there be…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.30,0:36:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何谈自身的宁静\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without justice and the love of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.30,0:36:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我详细地看了对您的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have studied the case against you very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.90,0:36:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会抓住一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will no doubt press the fact that the pope's dispensation…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.30,0:36:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是教皇给您和国王的结婚许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to allow you to marry the king was technically faulty…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是有错误的 于是婚姻无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and therefore invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.50,0:36:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要想克服 这些所谓的技术错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the obvious way of resolving any such technical deficiency…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.80,0:36:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是宣布婚姻无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is not to declare the marriage null and void…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是重新颁发合法的结婚证\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but to issue fresh and more perfect dispensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.10,0:36:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何 持续那么长久的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, the continuance of so long space…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.20,0:36:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自然也就合理合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has rendered the marriage honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.10,0:36:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且以教会作主为原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the principle of supplet ecclesia…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.70,0:36:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一切由教会作主」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let the church provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.00,0:37:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在教皇颁发的许可证里也有诸多漏洞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has itself made good any defects in the pope's dispensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.50,0:37:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意思是我们可能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you suppose we may win?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.90,0:37:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可能赢得案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may win the argument, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.50,0:37:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我得假装这对我们不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot pretend that it will avail us much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.70,0:37:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall still try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打起精神来 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be of good cheer, madam…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.80,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天使站在我们一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for we are on the side of the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.60,0:37:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最大的牌是红心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearts are trumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.80,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有克伦威尔的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard from Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他终于得以晋见教皇 但信上写 他无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was eventually allowed access to the pope but wrote in desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.30,0:37:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他觉得克莱门特不会帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't believe Clement will do anything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.80,0:37:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说… 「这也许是他的过错 但这违背了他的信条」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, " It might be in his paternoster, but it's nothing in his creed."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.90,0:37:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意思是 教皇愿意为我的灵魂祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pope might pray for me to solve my problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他不能承诺为我做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he won't personally commit to doing anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.90,0:38:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亮牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.90,0:38:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.60,0:38:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 在教皇特使路经法国时我们款待过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We entertained the pope as he passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.41,0:38:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本人也和坎贝吉奥交谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I spoke personally to Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.10,0:38:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个很谨慎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然只说了几句话 但我看得出他有所保留\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even in the few words he spoke, I thought he dissembled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.50,0:38:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪些方面有所保留\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what way dissembled?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他表现出的只是一面 而隐藏了另一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he shows one face but conceals another.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.10,0:38:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被派去做这件事 但他私底下很蔑视\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been asked to deal with a matter he secretly despises.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.90,0:38:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对国王 我的兄长 有个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my advice to the king, my brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是不要太相信任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is to not put too much trust in any man…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.90,0:38:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以免被人出卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in case he should be deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.70,0:38:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得沃尔西也是这样的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would you say the same of Cardinal Wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.30,0:39:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不反感主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing against His Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.90,0:39:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你认为他对离婚会有什么看法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do you think his attitude is towards the divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.90,0:39:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我个人认为 他倒是希望能离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I could tell, he wanted the divorce to go through…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他本人对王后并没有什么感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because he has no love for the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.60,0:39:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the same time…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.20,0:39:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.20,0:39:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感觉他和教皇陛下很有默契\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my impression that he has marvellous intelligence with the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.80,0:39:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是能理解对方 和坎贝吉奥大主教也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They understand each other. And also with Cardinal Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.30,0:39:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 国王应该意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, if he has such understanding with them…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.00,0:39:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不会对离婚的事有任何推进作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and they are not minded to advance the matter…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.89,0:39:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要我直说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then, to speak frankly to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王应该自己多关心一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I think the king should take a closer interest in it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.20,0:39:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.50,0:39:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.20,0:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去陪他的新情妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure to service his latest mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.80,0:40:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪里有这个必要 他已经有一个这么美丽的妻子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would he have to do that when he has such a beautiful wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.00,0:40:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这话你该去问他 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should ask him, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.10,0:40:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不想报复他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever want to pay him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.90,0:40:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 一直都想 但我是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, always. I'm a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.30,0:40:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么和我上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then go to bed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.00,0:40:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.50,0:40:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是请你先告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell me first…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.90,0:40:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的美丽妻子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how is your beautiful wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.80,0:40:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她… - 她就和我一样 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's… - She is just like me, non?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.90,0:40:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你的艳遇睁一只眼闭一只眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have affairs and she ignores it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.60,0:40:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了报复你而和别人做爱 为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make love for revenge or pain, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.50,0:40:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只会让人心力憔悴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.00,0:40:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会缩小的 你明白吗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the soul, it shrinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.00,0:40:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的灵魂会变渺小\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soul grows smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.40,0:41:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许会彻底死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps it even dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.20,0:41:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.20,0:41:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们单独谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.90,0:41:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会议要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trial is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.70,0:41:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.70,0:41:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想再次提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make it plain to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.50,0:41:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不批准离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you refuse to grant the divorce…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.70,0:42:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是对教皇不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will provoke a marvellous opinion against the pope…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.30,0:42:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对教廷 乃至对教会的不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}…against the papal courts, and against the papacy itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.40,0:42:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只对圣父本人负责 负责公正地处理这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am obliged to the Holy Father to seek truth and justice in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我也打算这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, Your Grace, I will attempt to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.40,0:42:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝为我作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as God is my witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.00,0:42:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好像还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still do not seem to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.70,0:42:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那让我再把话说明白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.10,0:42:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你作出对国王不利的判决\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fail to find in favour of the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.70,0:42:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会失去国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will lose the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.40,0:42:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及他为罗马奉献的疆土\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the devotion of his realm to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.00,0:42:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也会彻底毁了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will also utterly destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.60,0:42:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点我绝不能容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that I cannot allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.00,0:42:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.20,0:42:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要坚定信念 沃尔西主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have faith, Cardinal Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.30,0:42:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝会帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:43:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 沃尔西很明显已经妥协了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, it has become obvious that Wolsey is severely compromised…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.30,0:43:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和国王那种亲密信任的关系已经不再了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and no longer enjoys the affinity he used to share with His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.70,0:43:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王对他已经起了疑心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is suspicious of his first minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.00,0:43:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该顺水推舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should encourage those suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.30,0:43:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候把他拉下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time to bring him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这本小册子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is a pamphlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.00,0:43:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它嘲弄了他在职期间的傲慢 奢侈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, it mocks his period in office as a time of pride, waste…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.40,0:43:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镇压手段和他无用的政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}…repression and ineffectual policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.10,0:43:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候开始传播了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ready for distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.00,0:43:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要马上要求逮捕沃尔西和他的幕僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall call for the arrest of Wolsey and his agents…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}截获他们的信件文书 彻底检查他在职期间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the impounding of their papers and a thorough examination…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.30,0:43:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of his administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.60,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的腐败会暴露出来 叛国罪也逃不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}His corruption will be exposed and treason guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.50,0:43:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 博林 得由你的小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that remains, Boleyn, is for your daughter to prove to the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.40,0:43:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向国王证明 他的怀疑是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that all his suspicions are justified.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.00,0:43:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后… 主教将无法翻身\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the cardinal will be naked to his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.50,0:43:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 敬英格兰 - 敬英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To England. - To England.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.00,0:44:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的主啊 - 对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christ. - Sorry, sir. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.80,0:44:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对不起 - 狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Stupid dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.70,0:45:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.90,0:45:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.10,0:45:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我宣布 此次会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I declare this legatine court…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.20,0:45:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由克莱门特教皇陛下授权的会议 现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}…commissioned by His Holiness, Pope Clement, is now in session.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.90,0:45:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里说的每一句话必须宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that is said here is said under oath…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并受到万能上帝的监督\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and in the presence of God Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.00,0:45:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请国王陛下首先就此案进行陈述\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call upon His Majesty to speak first as to this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.80,0:45:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人知道我今天站到这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Eminences know well what cause I have to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.80,0:45:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}涉及到关于我婚姻的一些事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It concerns some scruples I have regarding my marriage…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这刺痛了我的良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which prick my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我广泛征求意见以解开真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have consulted widely to discover the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.20,0:46:13.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在《利末记》看到 这是违法上帝的法律的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have read in Leviticus that it was against God's law…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.40,0:46:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}娶自己兄长的妻子是一桩罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a sin, for me to marry my brother's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.80,0:46:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Eminences…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.40,0:46:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是唯一怀疑自己婚姻合法性的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am not the only one who questions the validity of my marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.80,0:46:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的主教们和我一样深怀疑虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of my bishops share my doubts…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.80,0:46:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们起草了一个情愿书希望澄清此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and they have signed a petition to put the matter to question.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.60,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我可以说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, I tell you now…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.50,0:46:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未在此类文件上签过字\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I never signed my name to any such document.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.80,0:46:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 如果签了 那是… - 没有要求你发言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And if it appears there… - Court has not invited you to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.40,0:46:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果唐斯托主教未经我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it appears there, then Bishop Tunstall wrote it…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代我签署\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without my consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.60,0:46:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在由国王陛下陈述 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has the floor. Sit down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.34,0:46:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 坐好 - 我现在不和你辩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit. - I'm not going to argue with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟这只是你一个人的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you are but one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.90,0:47:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the main issue…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.60,0:47:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有人问起 为什么我等了那么久才提起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if I am asked why I waited so long to bring this question to trial…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.30,0:47:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我据实回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I shall answer truthfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.90,0:47:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为我对王后陛下无比的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it was the great love that I bore for Her Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.90,0:47:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这爱让我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which prevented me doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.30,0:47:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我 仅仅是我个人的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is I, myself, who bear all responsibility…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.20,0:47:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为此我的良知一直在责备我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for my conscience which troubles and doubts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.50,0:47:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}庭上的先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen of the court…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.60,0:47:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只要求一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I ask for one thing and one thing only.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.50,0:47:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍后将要求王后陛下回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a moment, the court will call upon the queen's majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.27,0:47:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的陈述\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to reply to the king's statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.99,0:47:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我得先告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, I must tell the court…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.00,0:47:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下咨询了她的顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the queen has sought, through her advisers…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.20,0:48:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她怀疑本庭处理此案的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to question the competence of this court to try her case.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且她怀疑法官的公正性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further, she questions the impartiality of her judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.40,0:48:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后 她要求将案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, she contends that this matter is in the hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.60,0:48:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交予更高的权威 也就是教皇之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of a higher authority, namely the pope…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.80,0:48:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样就只能在罗马审理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and therefore can only be tried in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.40,0:48:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 关于第一点置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as for the first matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.00,0:48:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坎贝吉奥主教和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cardinal Campeggio and I can confirm…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.43,0:48:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是由教皇亲自授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that we have the necessary authorization from His Holiness…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.80,0:48:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而在这里审理此案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to try this matter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.10,0:48:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进一步来说 我们将拒绝任何形式的不公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further, we reject any notion of prejudice on our part…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.70,0:48:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会继续审理此案 这是我们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and will continue to try the case here as we have been appointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在请凯瑟林王后陛下 就此事发表看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I call upon Her Majesty, Queen Catherine, to address the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.10,0:49:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的王上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.70,0:49:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.10,0:49:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我乞求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beseech you…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.40,0:49:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在我们之间曾经的感情份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for all the love that has been between us…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.40,0:49:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我享有公平的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let me have justice and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.40,0:49:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请给予我同情和怜悯 因为我只是个可怜的妇人 一个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some pity and compassion, for I am a poor woman and a stranger…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.30,0:49:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生在您的疆域之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}…born out of your dominion.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.90,0:49:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这里没有朋友 也没有顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no friend here and little counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.90,0:49:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我求助您 是因为您是正义的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flee to you, as head of justice in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.20,0:49:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求上帝 以及全世界来为我作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call God and all the world to witness…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.60,0:49:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是您谦卑恭顺的合法妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I have been to you a true, humble and obedient wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.00,0:49:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}服从您的意愿 满足您的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ever comfortable to your will and pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.40,0:49:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了您 我爱您所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have loved all those whom you have loved, for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论我是否喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether or not I had cause…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.90,0:49:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是敌是友\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whether they be my friends or enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.50,0:50:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有过许多孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}By me, you have had many children…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.60,0:50:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然都蒙上帝的召唤离开了人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}…although it has pleased God to call them from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.70,0:50:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你第一次占有我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you had me at first…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.80,0:50:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝替我作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I take God as my judge…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.20,0:50:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是处女 并没有被任何男人碰过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I was a true maid without touch of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.30,0:50:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此话是真是假\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether or not it be true…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.10,0:50:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I put it to your conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.10,0:50:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在她又要做什么 - 羞辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, what is she doing? - Shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.70,0:50:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰王后 凯瑟林 回到庭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine, queen of England, come back into the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.20,0:51:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到庭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back into the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也许该回去 在叫您呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Your Majesty should turn back. You are being called.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.70,0:51:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个法庭对我毫无意义 我不会在这里待下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This court has no meaning for me. Therefore, I will not stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.00,0:51:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰王后 凯瑟林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine, queen of England…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.70,0:51:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到庭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…come back into the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.60,0:51:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她无视教会法\N{\fnArial\fs30}She spits in the face of papal law.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.50,0:51:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蔑视这个法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}She holds this court in contempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.73,0:52:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
